#. Your licenses are on all their devices. Replace a device to use one here.
#. Choose a license for this device (SIGN-IN.md §3.6).
msgid "signin.choice.allFull"
msgstr "Alle Ihre Lizenzen haben ihr Gerätelimit erreicht. Ersetzen Sie ein Gerät, um hier eine davon zu verwenden."

#. Your licenses are on all their devices. Replace a device, or create a new free license.
#. Choose a license for this device (SIGN-IN.md §3.6).
msgid "signin.choice.allFullCreate"
msgstr "Alle Ihre Lizenzen haben ihr Gerätelimit erreicht. Ersetzen Sie ein Gerät oder erstellen Sie eine neue kostenlose Lizenz."

#. {developer} manages devices for these licenses. Ask {developer} to free one, or use another license.
#. Choose a license for this device (SIGN-IN.md §3.6). Arguments: {developer} = the developer's name (never translated).
msgid "signin.choice.noneReplaceable"
msgstr "{developer} verwaltet die Geräte für diese Lizenzen. Bitten Sie {developer}, eines freizugeben, oder verwenden Sie eine andere Lizenz."

#. Your other {product} items still apply.
#. Choose a license for this device (SIGN-IN.md §3.6). Arguments: {product} = the product's name from ProductIdentity (never translated).
msgid "signin.choice.combined"
msgstr "Ihre anderen Inhalte für {product} gelten weiterhin."

#. {developer} manages devices for this license.
#. Choose a license for this device (SIGN-IN.md §3.6). Arguments: {developer} = the developer's name (never translated).
msgid "signin.choice.portalOff"
msgstr "{developer} verwaltet die Geräte für diese Lizenz."

#. Use a license key instead
#. Choose a license for this device (SIGN-IN.md §3.6).
msgid "signin.choice.keyInstead"
msgstr "Stattdessen Lizenzschlüssel verwenden"

#. macos: Use a License Key Instead
msgctxt "macos"
msgid "signin.choice.keyInstead"
msgstr "Stattdessen Lizenzschlüssel verwenden"

#. Free a device
#. Choose a license for this device (SIGN-IN.md §3.6).
msgid "signin.choice.freeDevice"
msgstr "Gerät freigeben"

#. macos: Free a Device
msgctxt "macos"
msgid "signin.choice.freeDevice"
msgstr "Gerät freigeben"

#. Use this license
#. Choose a license for this device (SIGN-IN.md §3.6).
msgid "signin.choice.continue"
msgstr "Diese Lizenz verwenden und fortfahren"

#. macos: Use This License
msgctxt "macos"
msgid "signin.choice.continue"
msgstr "Diese Lizenz verwenden und fortfahren"

#. That device was just replaced. Choose again.
#. Choose a license for this device (SIGN-IN.md §3.6).
msgid "signin.choice.raced"
msgstr "Dieses Gerät wurde gerade ersetzt. Wählen Sie erneut."

#. The code on {device} expired. Get a new code there and scan it again.
#. Choose a license for this device (SIGN-IN.md §3.6). Arguments: {device} = a device's friendly name, for example “Maya's MacBook”.
msgid "signin.choice.codeExpired"
msgstr "Der Code auf {device} ist abgelaufen. Fordern Sie dort einen neuen Code an und scannen Sie ihn erneut."

#. No {product} license in this account
#. No license in this account (SIGN-IN.md §3.6). Arguments: {product} = the product's name from ProductIdentity (never translated).
msgid "signin.none.title"
msgstr "Keine Lizenz für {product} in diesem Konto"

#. Bought it with another email? Sign in with that account instead.
#. No license in this account (SIGN-IN.md §3.6).
msgid "signin.none.body"
msgstr "Mit einer anderen E-Mail-Adresse gekauft? Melden Sie sich stattdessen mit diesem Konto an."

#. Get {product}
#. No license in this account (SIGN-IN.md §3.6). Arguments: {product} = the product's name from ProductIdentity (never translated).
msgid "signin.none.get"
msgstr "{product} erwerben"

#. Use another account
#. No license in this account (SIGN-IN.md §3.6).
msgid "signin.none.otherAccount"
msgstr "Anderes Konto verwenden"

#. macos: Use Another Account
msgctxt "macos"
msgid "signin.none.otherAccount"
msgstr "Anderes Konto verwenden"

#. Replace a device
#. Device limit with no license rows, reached from automatic sign-in or a provider sign-in (KFA-0): opens the page that replaces a device. The kit draws the new-window glyph beside it; its description is a11y.externalLink.
msgid "signin.deviceLimit.replace"
msgstr "Gerät ersetzen"

#. macos: Replace a Device
msgctxt "macos"
msgid "signin.deviceLimit.replace"
msgstr "Gerät ersetzen"

#. Replace a device
#. Replace a device, inline in the license choice (SIGN-IN.md §3.7).
msgid "signin.replace.open"
msgstr "Gerät ersetzen"

#. macos: Replace a Device
msgctxt "macos"
msgid "signin.replace.open"
msgstr "Gerät ersetzen"

#. Choose a device to sign out. {thisDevice} takes its place.
#. Replace a device, as a step in the in-app form (SIGN-IN.md §3.7). Arguments: {thisDevice} = the platform phrase for the current device (part.thisDevice).
msgid "signin.replace.lede"
msgstr "Wählen Sie ein Gerät zum Abmelden. Es wird durch {thisDevice} ersetzt."

#. Replace a device
#. Replace a device, inline in the license choice (SIGN-IN.md §3.7). The step's heading; the same words as the DeviceLimit title.
msgid "signin.replace.heading"
msgstr "Gerät ersetzen"

#. Replace…
#. Replace a device in a system dialog (SIGN-IN.md §3.7).
msgid "signin.replace.openSystem"
msgstr "Ersetzen…"

#. {platform} · last used {when}
#. Replace a device, inline in the license choice (SIGN-IN.md §3.7). Arguments: {platform} = the device's platform name (macOS, Windows, iPhone…); {when} = a relative time already formatted by the platform (“2 days ago”).
msgid "signin.replace.meta"
msgstr "{platform} · zuletzt verwendet {when}"

#. Least recent
#. Replace a device, inline in the license choice (SIGN-IN.md §3.7).
msgid "signin.replace.leastRecent"
msgstr "Am längsten inaktiv"

#. Active now
#. Replace a device, inline in the license choice (SIGN-IN.md §3.7).
msgid "signin.replace.activeNow"
msgstr "Gerade aktiv"

#. This browser
#. Replace a device, inline in the license choice (SIGN-IN.md §3.7).
msgid "signin.replace.thisBrowser"
msgstr "Dieser Browser"

#. Replace {device}?
#. Replace a device, inline in the license choice (SIGN-IN.md §3.7). Arguments: {device} = a device's friendly name, for example “Maya's MacBook”.
msgid "signin.replace.title"
msgstr "{device} ersetzen?"

#. {device} signs out of {product} and {thisDevice} takes its place. We'll email you about it.
#. Replace a device, inline in the license choice (SIGN-IN.md §3.7). Arguments: {device} = a device's friendly name, for example “Maya's MacBook”; {product} = the product's name from ProductIdentity (never translated); {thisDevice} = the platform phrase for the current device (part.thisDevice, for example “this iPhone”).
msgid "signin.replace.consequence"
msgstr "{device} wird von {product} abgemeldet und durch {thisDevice} ersetzt. Wir informieren Sie per E-Mail darüber."

#. {device} is in use right now.
#. Replace a device, inline in the license choice (SIGN-IN.md §3.7). Arguments: {device} = a device's friendly name, for example “Maya's MacBook”.
msgid "signin.replace.inUse"
msgstr "{device} wird gerade verwendet."

#. Replace and continue
#. Replace a device, inline in the license choice (SIGN-IN.md §3.7).
msgid "signin.replace.confirm"
msgstr "Ersetzen und fortfahren"

#. macos: Replace and Continue
msgctxt "macos"
msgid "signin.replace.confirm"
msgstr "Ersetzen und fortfahren"

#. Replace {device}
#. Replace a device, inline in the license choice (SIGN-IN.md §3.7). The primary once a device is picked, in place of the generic one. Arguments: {device} = a device's friendly name, for example “Maya's MacBook”.
msgid "signin.replace.confirmNamed"
msgstr "{device} ersetzen"

#. Back
#. Replace a device, inline in the license choice (SIGN-IN.md §3.7).
msgid "signin.replace.back"
msgstr "Zurück"

#. That device was already removed. Choose again.
#. Replace a device, inline in the license choice (SIGN-IN.md §3.7).
msgid "signin.replace.gone"
msgstr "Dieses Gerät wurde bereits entfernt. Wählen Sie erneut."

#. Too many device changes. Try again in {seconds, plural, one {# second} other {# seconds}}.
#. Replace a device, inline in the license choice (SIGN-IN.md §3.7). Arguments: {seconds} = a number of seconds.
#. Plural on {seconds}.
msgid "signin.replace.rateLimited"
msgid_plural "signin.replace.rateLimited"
msgstr[0] "Zu viele Geräteänderungen. Versuchen Sie es in {seconds} Sekunde erneut."
msgstr[1] "Zu viele Geräteänderungen. Versuchen Sie es in {seconds} Sekunden erneut."

#. Someone replaced that device first. Choose again.
#. Replace a device, inline in the license choice (SIGN-IN.md §3.7).
msgid "signin.replace.raced"
msgstr "Jemand anderes hat dieses Gerät zuerst ersetzt. Wählen Sie erneut."

#. {device} was removed, but someone signed in first. Choose again.
#. Replace a device, inline in the license choice (SIGN-IN.md §3.7). Arguments: {device} = a device's friendly name, for example “Maya's MacBook”.
msgid "signin.replace.racedAfterFree"
msgstr "{device} wurde entfernt, aber jemand hat sich zuerst angemeldet. Wählen Sie erneut."

#. Continue to {app} as {name}?
#. Consent step before returning to the app (SIGN-IN.md §3.8). Arguments: {app} = the requesting app's name (never translated); {name} = the person's display name.
msgid "signin.consent.title"
msgstr "Als {name} mit {app} fortfahren?"

#. License for this device
#. Consent step before returning to the app (SIGN-IN.md §3.8).
msgid "signin.consent.license"
msgstr "Lizenz für dieses Gerät"

#. {license} · {term} · {device} becomes device {position} of {limit}
#. Consent step before returning to the app (SIGN-IN.md §3.8). Arguments: {license} = the license's name, usually product and tier; {term} = the license term (one of the signin.term.* strings); {device} = a device's friendly name, for example “Maya's MacBook”, or, when the kit has no name, the lower-case part.thisDevice phrase (“this device”), never the capitalised part.thisDeviceTitle, because the line reads on after a separator; {position} = the device's seat number, as a number; {limit} = the license's device limit, as a number.
msgid "signin.consent.licenseLine"
msgstr "{license} · {term} · für {device} (Gerät {position} von {limit})"

#. {license} · replaces {device}
#. Consent step before returning to the app (SIGN-IN.md §3.8). Arguments: {license} = the license's name, usually product and tier; {device} = a device's friendly name, for example “Maya's MacBook”.
msgid "signin.consent.replaces"
msgstr "{license} · ersetzt {device}"

#. You'll choose a license in {app}.
#. Consent step before returning to the app (SIGN-IN.md §3.8), when the license is chosen in the app (I-04 §G). Arguments: {app} = the requesting app's name (never translated).
msgid "signin.consent.licenseInApp"
msgstr "Sie wählen die Lizenz in {app}."

#. Change
#. Consent step before returning to the app (SIGN-IN.md §3.8).
msgid "signin.consent.change"
msgstr "Ändern"

#. Continue to {app}
#. Consent step before returning to the app (SIGN-IN.md §3.8). Arguments: {app} = the requesting app's name (never translated).
msgid "signin.consent.continue"
msgstr "Weiter zu {app}"

#. {app} will also get
#. Consent step before returning to the app (SIGN-IN.md §3.8). Arguments: {app} = the requesting app's name (never translated).
msgid "signin.consent.alsoGets"
msgstr "{app} erhält außerdem"

#. Your profile and email
#. Consent step before returning to the app (SIGN-IN.md §3.8).
msgid "signin.consent.profile"
msgstr "Ihr Profil und Ihre E-Mail-Adresse"

#. It gets its own id for you, and won't see your other apps or how you sign in.
#. Consent step before returning to the app (SIGN-IN.md §3.8).
msgid "signin.consent.pairwise"
msgstr "Die App erhält eine eigene ID für Sie und sieht weder Ihre anderen Apps noch, wie Sie sich anmelden."

#. Not you?
#. Hosted sign-in card (SIGN-IN.md).
msgid "signin.notYou"
msgstr "Nicht Sie?"

#. macos: Not You?
msgctxt "macos"
msgid "signin.notYou"
msgstr "Nicht Sie?"

#. Cancel
#. Hosted sign-in card (SIGN-IN.md).
msgid "signin.cancel"
msgstr "Abbrechen"

#. Add {product} to your account
#. License key step (SIGN-IN.md §3.9). Arguments: {product} = the product's name from ProductIdentity (never translated).
msgid "signin.key.addTitle"
msgstr "{product} zu Ihrem Konto hinzufügen"

#. Add and use on this device
#. License key step (SIGN-IN.md §3.9).
msgid "signin.key.addAndUse"
msgstr "Hinzufügen und auf diesem Gerät verwenden"

#. macos: Add and Use on This Device
msgctxt "macos"
msgid "signin.key.addAndUse"
msgstr "Hinzufügen und auf diesem Gerät verwenden"

#. Keep {product} in an account
#. License key step (SIGN-IN.md §3.9). Arguments: {product} = the product's name from ProductIdentity (never translated).
msgid "signin.key.keep"
msgstr "{product} in einem Konto behalten"

#. macos: Keep {product} in an Account
msgctxt "macos"
msgid "signin.key.keep"
msgstr "{product} in einem Konto behalten"

#. {left} of {limit} key entries left · This will be entry {n}
#. License key step (SIGN-IN.md §3.9). Arguments: {left} = how many are left, as a number; {limit} = the license's device limit, as a number; {n} = a number.
msgid "signin.key.entries"
msgstr "Noch {left} von {limit} Schlüsseleingaben · Dies wird Eingabe {n}"

#. {left, plural, one {# key entry left} other {# key entries left}}
#. License key step (SIGN-IN.md §3.9). Arguments: {left} = how many are left, as a number.
#. Plural on {left}.
msgid "signin.key.entriesLeftShort"
msgid_plural "signin.key.entriesLeftShort"
msgstr[0] "Noch {left} Schlüsseleingabe"
msgstr[1] "Noch {left} Schlüsseleingaben"

#. This key has no entries left in {product}. Add it to your account and {product} signs you in instead.
#. License key step (SIGN-IN.md §3.9). Arguments: {product} = the product's name from ProductIdentity (never translated).
msgid "signin.key.noEntries"
msgstr "Für diesen Schlüssel sind in {product} keine Eingaben mehr übrig. Fügen Sie ihn Ihrem Konto hinzu, dann meldet {product} Sie stattdessen an."

#. Skip for now
#. License key step (SIGN-IN.md §3.9).
msgid "signin.key.skip"
msgstr "Jetzt nicht"

#. macos: Skip for Now
msgctxt "macos"
msgid "signin.key.skip"
msgstr "Jetzt nicht"

#. Sign in to that account
#. License key step (SIGN-IN.md §3.9).
msgid "signin.key.ownedSignIn"
msgstr "Bei diesem Konto anmelden"

#. macos: Sign In to That Account
msgctxt "macos"
msgid "signin.key.ownedSignIn"
msgstr "Bei diesem Konto anmelden"

#. Sign in
#. The key-entry limit's refusal step: starts the kit's own sign-in; the key is added to the account afterwards.
msgid "signin.key.signIn"
msgstr "Anmelden"

#. macos: Sign In
msgctxt "macos"
msgid "signin.key.signIn"
msgstr "Anmelden"

#. Use a different key
#. License key step (SIGN-IN.md §3.9).
msgid "signin.key.differentKey"
msgstr "Anderen Schlüssel verwenden"

#. macos: Use a Different Key
msgctxt "macos"
msgid "signin.key.differentKey"
msgstr "Anderen Schlüssel verwenden"

#. Continue to {app}
#. Automatic sign-in (I-46.1): the confirm step. Arguments: {app} = the app's name (never translated).
msgid "signin.auto.confirm.title"
msgstr "Weiter zu {app}"

#. as {email}
#. Automatic sign-in: the confirm step names the account. Arguments: {email} = the account's email address (never translated).
msgid "signin.auto.confirm.as"
msgstr "als {email}"

#. with your Apple Account
#. Automatic sign-in: the confirm step when the provider shared no email (Sign in with Apple, private).
msgid "signin.auto.confirm.asApple"
msgstr "mit Ihrem Apple Account"

#. Continue
#. Automatic sign-in: the confirm step's main button.
msgid "signin.auto.confirm.primary"
msgstr "Weiter"

#. Use another account
#. Automatic sign-in: the confirm step's secondary button; opens the regular sign-in.
msgid "signin.auto.confirm.other"
msgstr "Anderes Konto verwenden"

#. macos: Use Another Account
msgctxt "macos"
msgid "signin.auto.confirm.other"
msgstr "Anderes Konto verwenden"

#. Sign in with {provider} next time?
#. Link offer, after a regular sign-in: link the provider so the next sign-in is automatic. Arguments: {provider} = the provider's name (never translated).
msgid "signin.linkOffer.title"
msgstr "Nächstes Mal mit {provider} anmelden?"

#. Then {app} and other apps that use Polaris Locker can sign you in automatically.
#. Link offer: what linking does where the provider's identity is shared across developers. Arguments: {app} = the app's name (never translated).
msgid "signin.linkOffer.bodyGlobal"
msgstr "Dann können {app} und andere Apps mit Polaris Locker Sie selbstständig anmelden."

#. Then apps from {developer} can sign you in automatically.
#. Link offer: what linking does where the provider's identity is per developer (Apple always). Arguments: {developer} = the developer's name (never translated).
msgid "signin.linkOffer.bodyDeveloper"
msgstr "Dann können Apps von {developer} Sie selbstständig anmelden."

#. Then {app} and its developer's other apps can sign you in automatically.
#. Link offer when the developer's name is unknown. Arguments: {app} = the app's name (never translated).
msgid "signin.linkOffer.bodyApp"
msgstr "Dann können {app} und die anderen Apps des Entwicklers Sie selbstständig anmelden."

#. Link {provider}
#. Link offer: the main button. Arguments: {provider} = the provider's name (never translated).
msgid "signin.linkOffer.primary"
msgstr "{provider} verknüpfen"

#. No thanks
#. Link offer: declines; the device remembers it.
msgid "signin.linkOffer.decline"
msgstr "Nein, danke"

#. macos: No Thanks
msgctxt "macos"
msgid "signin.linkOffer.decline"
msgstr "Nein, danke"

#. Sign in again to link {provider}.
#. Link offer: the sign-in is too old to link; the main button becomes Sign in again. Arguments: {provider} = the provider's name (never translated).
msgid "signin.linkOffer.stale"
msgstr "Melde dich erneut an, um {provider} zu verknüpfen."

#. Couldn't link {provider} on this device.
#. Link offer: this device or its proof was refused, so trying again cannot help; the person can decline. Arguments: {provider} = the provider's name (never translated).
msgid "signin.linkOffer.failed"
msgstr "{provider} konnte auf diesem Gerät nicht verknüpft werden."

#. {provider} linked
#. Link offer: the link succeeded. Arguments: {provider} = the provider's name (never translated).
msgid "signin.linkOffer.done"
msgstr "{provider} verknüpft"

#. {provider} not linked
#. Link offer: the provider account is already linked elsewhere. Arguments: {provider} = the provider's name (never translated).
msgid "signin.linkOffer.conflictTitle"
msgstr "{provider} nicht verknüpft"

#. This {provider} account belongs to another Polaris Locker account. You're still signed in.
#. Link offer: the provider account belongs to another Polaris Locker account; the sign-in stands. Arguments: {provider} = the provider's name (never translated).
msgid "signin.linkOffer.conflict"
msgstr "Dieses {provider}-Konto gehört zu einem anderen Konto bei Polaris Locker. Sie bleiben angemeldet."

#. Join accounts
#. Link offer conflict: opens Help on joining two accounts.
msgid "signin.linkOffer.join"
msgstr "Konten zusammenführen"

#. macos: Join Accounts
msgctxt "macos"
msgid "signin.linkOffer.join"
msgstr "Konten zusammenführen"

#. Approve on your other device
#. Nearby sign-in, on the device that signs in: waits for approval on another device.
msgid "signin.nearby.title"
msgstr "Auf Ihrem anderen Gerät bestätigen"

#. Sign in with your phone
#. Nearby sign-in, before the system asks for access to the local network.
msgid "signin.nearby.promptTitle"
msgstr "Mit dem Telefon anmelden"

#. Open {app} on a phone or computer that's signed in and on this network.
#. Nearby sign-in, waiting. Arguments: {app} = the app's name (never translated).
msgid "signin.nearby.body"
msgstr "Öffnen Sie {app} auf einem Telefon oder Computer, der angemeldet und in diesem Netzwerk ist."

#. Tap this code there:
#. Nearby sign-in, waiting: the line above the code the other device must tap.
msgid "signin.nearby.match"
msgstr "Tippen Sie dort auf diesen Code:"

#. Use a code instead
#. Nearby sign-in, waiting: switches to the device code.
msgid "signin.nearby.code"
msgstr "Stattdessen einen Code verwenden"

#. macos: Use a Code Instead
msgctxt "macos"
msgid "signin.nearby.code"
msgstr "Stattdessen einen Code verwenden"

#. Signed in as {email}
#. Nearby sign-in, done. Arguments: {email} = the account's email address (never translated).
msgid "signin.nearby.done"
msgstr "Angemeldet als {email}"

#. Not you?
#. Nearby sign-in, done: opens the sign-out and review step when the account is not the person's.
msgid "signin.nearby.notYou"
msgstr "Nicht Sie?"

#. macos: Not You?
msgctxt "macos"
msgid "signin.nearby.notYou"
msgstr "Nicht Sie?"

#. Next, allow {app} to find devices on your network, so your phone can sign you in.
#. Nearby sign-in: shown before the system asks for access to devices on the local network (L-11). Arguments: {app} = the app's name (never translated).
msgid "signin.nearby.prePrompt"
msgstr "Erlauben Sie {app} als Nächstes, Geräte in Ihrem Netzwerk zu finden, damit Ihr Telefon Sie anmelden kann."

#. Let {device} sign in?
#. Nearby approval, on the signed-in device. Arguments: {device} = the new device's friendly name (never translated).
msgid "signin.nearby.ask"
msgstr "{device} die Anmeldung erlauben?"

#. Tap the code it shows.
#. Nearby approval: number matching. Three 6-digit codes follow; one matches the code the new device shows. Arguments: {device} = the new device's friendly name (never translated).
msgid "signin.nearby.askBody"
msgstr "Tippen Sie auf den Code, den es anzeigt."

#. {device} is signed in
#. Nearby approval: the new device is signed in. Arguments: {device} = the new device's friendly name (never translated).
msgid "signin.nearby.approved"
msgstr "{device} ist angemeldet"

#. {device} isn't on this network
#. Nearby approval: the new device is not on the approver's network. Arguments: {device} = the new device's friendly name (never translated).
msgid "signin.nearby.notNearby"
msgstr "{device} ist nicht in diesem Netzwerk"

#. Connect both to the same Wi-Fi, or sign in with a code on {device}.
#. Nearby approval: the new device is not on the approver's network. Arguments: {device} = the new device's friendly name (never translated).
msgid "signin.nearby.notNearbyBody"
msgstr "Verbinden Sie beide mit demselben WLAN oder melden Sie sich auf {device} mit einem Code an."

#. That code didn't match, so {device} wasn't signed in.
#. Nearby approval: the person tapped a code that did not match; the request is denied. Arguments: {device} = the new device's friendly name (never translated).
msgid "signin.nearby.mismatch"
msgstr "Dieser Code stimmte nicht überein, daher wurde {device} nicht angemeldet."

#. Approve a nearby device
#. Account menu entry: opens the nearby approval list on the signed-in device.
msgid "signin.nearby.menu"
msgstr "Gerät in der Nähe bestätigen"

#. macos: Approve a Nearby Device
msgctxt "macos"
msgid "signin.nearby.menu"
msgstr "Gerät in der Nähe bestätigen"

#. Choose a license for {device}
#. Nearby approval, on the signed-in device: choose which license the new device gets. Arguments: {device} = the new device's friendly name (never translated).
msgid "signin.nearby.chooseTitle"
msgstr "Lizenz für {device} auswählen"

#. {product} will use it.
#. Nearby approval: choose a license. Arguments: {product} = the product's name from ProductIdentity (never translated).
msgid "signin.nearby.chooseLede"
msgstr "{product} verwendet sie."

#. This license is on all its devices. Remove one to make room for {device}.
#. Nearby approval: the license is on all its devices. Body under the Device limit reached title; the action opens the device list. Arguments: {device} = the new device's friendly name (never translated).
msgid "signin.nearby.deviceLimitBody"
msgstr "Diese Lizenz ist auf allen ihren Geräten aktiv. Entfernen Sie eines, um Platz für {device} zu schaffen."

#. Wait a moment, then try again on {device}.
#. Nearby approval: too many attempts. Body under the Too many attempts title; the action is Done, because the retry happens on the new device. Arguments: {device} = the new device's friendly name (never translated).
msgid "signin.nearby.rateLimitedBody"
msgstr "Warten Sie einen Moment und versuchen Sie es dann auf {device} erneut."

#. Start again on {device}.
#. Nearby approval: the code expired. Body under the Code expired title; the person starts again on the new device. Arguments: {device} = the new device's friendly name (never translated).
msgid "signin.nearby.expiredBody"
